DESCRIPTION:Tommy Pope is a comedian\, writer and actor originally from Phi
 ladelphia\, PA. He is a Series Regular on Netflix's TIRES\, co-host of the 
 podcast STUFF ISLAND\, and host of the YouTube series LOOK AT DISH. He was 
 a recurring character on the sketch comedy series GILLY & KEEVES and co-cre
 ator of the web comedy television series DELCO PROPER\, which was featured 
 on Comedy Central. Most recently\, he has voiced characters on the FOX anim
 ated series UNIVERSAL BASIC GUYS.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 prem
 ium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Tic
 ket Protection\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, 
